{
    "chapter_num": 23,
    "verses_count": 56,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Handed Over to Pontius Pilate"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the whole multitude of them arose and led Him to Pilate. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they began to accuse Him, saying, “We found this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fellow"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perverting "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the nation, and forbidding to pay taxes to Caesar, saying that He Himself is Christ, a King.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate asked Him, saying, “Are You the King of the Jews?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He answered him and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is as you say.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Pilate said to the chief priests and the crowd, “I find no fault in this Man.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they were the more fierce, saying, “He stirs up the people, teaching throughout all Judea, beginning from Galilee to this place.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Faces Herod"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Pilate heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits of Galilee"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of Galilee, he asked if the Man were a Galilean. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as soon as he knew that He belonged to Herod’s jurisdiction, he sent Him to Herod, who was also in Jerusalem at that time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Herod saw Jesus, he was exceedingly glad; for he had desired for a long "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "time"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to see Him, because he had heard many things about Him, and he hoped to see some miracle done by Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he questioned Him with many words, but He answered him nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the chief priests and scribes stood and vehemently accused Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Herod, with his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "troops"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "men of war, treated Him with contempt and mocked "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " arrayed Him in a gorgeous robe, and sent Him back to Pilate. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "That very day Pilate and Herod became friends with each other, for previously they had been at enmity with each other."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Taking the Place of Barabbas"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate, when he had called together the chief priests, the rulers, and the people, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "said to them, “You have brought this Man to me, as one who misleads the people. And indeed, having examined "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in your presence, I have found no fault in this Man concerning those things of which you accuse Him; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "no, neither did Herod, for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU he sent Him back to us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I sent you back to him; and indeed nothing deserving of death has been done by Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I will therefore chastise Him and release "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits v. 17."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " it was necessary for him to release one to them at the feast)."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they all cried out at once, saying, “Away with this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Man,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and release to us Barabbas”— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who had been thrown into prison for a certain rebellion made in the city, and for murder."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate, therefore, wishing to release Jesus, again called out to them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they shouted, saying, “Crucify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " crucify Him!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he said to them the third time, “Why, what evil has He done? I have found no reason for death in Him. I will therefore chastise Him and let "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " go.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they were insistent, demanding with loud voices that He be crucified. And the voices of these men "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits and of the chief priests"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and of the chief priests prevailed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Pilate gave sentence that it should be as they requested. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he released "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit to them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to them the one they requested, who for rebellion and murder had been thrown into prison; but he delivered Jesus to their will."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The King on a Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now as they led Him away, they laid hold of a certain man, Simon a Cyrenian, who was coming from the country, and on him they laid the cross that he might bear "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " after Jesus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And a great multitude of the people followed Him, and women who also mourned and lamented Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus, turning to them, said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Daughters of Jerusalem, do not weep for Me, but weep for yourselves and for your children."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For indeed the days are coming in which they will say, ‘Blessed are the barren, wombs that never bore, and breasts which never nursed!’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Then they will begin"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘to say to the mountains, “Fall on us!” and to the hills, “Cover us!” ’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For if they do these things in the green wood, what will be done in the dry?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There were also two others, criminals, led with Him to be put to death. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they had come to the place called Calvary, there they crucified Him, and the criminals, one on the right hand and the other on the left. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU brackets the first sentence as a later addition."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Father,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "forgive them, for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "they do not know what they do.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they divided His garments and cast lots. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the people stood looking on. But even the rulers with them sneered, saying, “He saved others; let Him save Himself if He is the Christ, the chosen of God.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The soldiers also mocked Him, coming and offering Him sour wine, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and saying, “If You are the King of the Jews, save Yourself.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And an inscription also was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits written and in letters of Greek, Latin, and Hebrew"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "written over Him in letters of Greek, Latin, and Hebrew:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "THIS IS THE KING OF THE JEWS."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one of the criminals who were hanged blasphemed Him, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Are You not the Christ? Save"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“If You are the Christ, save Yourself and us.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the other, answering, rebuked him, saying, “Do you not even fear God, seeing you are under the same condemnation? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we indeed justly, for we receive the due reward of our deeds; but this Man has done nothing wrong.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he said "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU “Jesus, remember me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to Jesus, “Lord, remember me when You come into Your kingdom.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Assuredly, I say to you, today you will be with Me in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Paradise.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Dies on the Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds already"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "was about the sixth hour, and there was darkness over all the earth until the ninth hour. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the sun was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU obscured"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "darkened, and the veil of the temple was torn in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "the middle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "two. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when Jesus had cried out with a loud voice, He said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Father,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘into Your hands I commit My spirit.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Having said this, He breathed His last."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 47,
                    "num_str": "47",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when the centurion saw what had happened, he glorified God, saying, “Certainly this was a righteous Man!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 48,
                    "num_str": "48",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the whole crowd who came together to that sight, seeing what had been done, beat their breasts and returned. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 49,
                    "num_str": "49",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But all His acquaintances, and the women who followed Him from Galilee, stood at a distance, watching these things."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Buried in Joseph’s Tomb"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 50,
                    "num_str": "50",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now behold, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a man named Joseph, a council member, a good and just man. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 51,
                    "num_str": "51",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He had not consented to their decision and deed. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "He was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Arimathea, a city of the Jews, who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU who was waiting"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " himself was also waiting for the kingdom of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 52,
                    "num_str": "52",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
